    out.innerHTML=`<h4>${theoryLink(id)}</h4><dl class="trust-summary"><div><dt>Entry provenance</dt><dd>${esc(t.provenance||'Not recorded')}</dd></div><div><dt>Representative mathematics</dt><dd>${esc(audit?.classification||'Not reviewed')} · ${fs.length} linked formulas</dd></div><div><dt>Reading profile</dt><dd>${profile?'Present':'Not curated'}</dd></div><div><dt>Theory Passport</dt><dd>${passport?'Present; reviewed '+esc(passport.reviewedAt||window.QI_PASSPORTS.reviewedAt):'Not curated'}</dd></div><div><dt>Linked Evidence records</dt><dd>${evidence.length} (association, not confirmation)</dd></div><div><dt>Incident relationships</dt><dd>${sourced.length} eligible source-backed; ${edges.length-sourced.length} other/editorial</dd></div></dl>${audit?.gapReason?`<p>${esc(audit.gapReason)}</p>`:''}<h5>Entry bibliography (${ids.length})</h5>${ids.length?sourceList(ids):'<p>No entry-level sources attached.</p>'}<h5>Formula metadata (${fs.length})</h5>${fs.length?`<ul>${fs.map(f=>`<li><a href="#/formula?theory=${encodeURIComponent(id)}&search=${encodeURIComponent(f.name||f.title||f.id)}&returnTo=${encodeURIComponent(location.hash)}">${esc(f.name||f.title||f.id)}</a> · ${esc(f.metadataReview)} · ${(f.sourceLocations||[]).length} source locators${f.reviewedAt?' · reviewed '+esc(f.reviewedAt):''}</li>`).join('')}</ul>`:'<p>No representative formula linked.</p>'}<p>Explicit metadata review covers the equation’s recorded scope, assumptions and source locators. Baseline metadata still needs equation-level review.</p><h5>Evidence records</h5>${evidence.length?`<ul>${evidence.map(e=>`<li><a href="#/evidence?search=${encodeURIComponent(e.title)}">${esc(e.title||e.name||e.id)}</a> · ${esc(e.type)}</li>`).join('')}</ul>`:'<p>No linked Evidence record curated.</p>'}<details><summary>Inspect ${sourced.length} source-backed incident relationships</summary>${sourced.length?`<ol class="research-edges">${sourced.map(edgeMarkup).join('')}</ol>`:'<p>No eligible documented relationships a